[gd_scene load_steps=35 format=3]

; M3-BPR-01: Oruvel raft-town, the net-pen hull (Ch1 C1-13/C1-14: the scuttlers and Hullgnaw), greybox until
; env-art's raft-town kit lands (M3-ENV-06). Grade from docs/kb/art/color_script.md "Ch1": 10:30, sun 58 deg, key
; #FFEFE1 3.0, fill #8FC3E0 0.6, sky #2E7FD6 / #A9DCF2, fog #BFDDE8, exposure 0.65, saturation x1.12; the sea is
; lagoon_clear. The storm wall stands on the horizon under a still-blue sky (act1_ch01.md O18; the lut_ch01_storm
; variant is env-art's). A lashed square deck at y = 0 around the fighters, the Reefball net behind the foes, the plank
; bridge to the keel-hull behind the party (Kell's beacon lamp lit on it), raft huts with small awning notes.

